WEBVTT

00:08:59.827 --> 00:09:02.204
or hopefully, called your face mask.

00:09:03.163 --> 00:09:04.331
In the last two years,

00:09:04.331 --> 00:09:07.251
we've heard a lot
about how face masks stop germs

00:09:07.293 --> 00:09:09.211
through that physical fabric.

00:09:09.878 --> 00:09:12.423
But they’re cultural
signaling devices, too.

00:09:12.756 --> 00:09:15.467
They send messages to your own brain

00:09:15.509 --> 00:09:17.469
to remind you to change behavior,

00:09:17.469 --> 00:09:21.140
to each other, to show
whether you respect science,

00:09:21.181 --> 00:09:23.267
whether you are upholding community norms.

00:09:23.976 --> 00:09:27.980
And although doctors don't often talk
about that cultural aspect, we need to.

00:09:28.022 --> 00:09:29.607
Because one thing we've learned,

00:09:29.607 --> 00:09:31.400
is you can't stop a pandemic